DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270406
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270412
SUMMARY:Sun 'n Fun Aerospace Expo
LOCATION:Lakeland Linder International Airport
DESCRIPTION:Second-largest aviation expo in the US and the traditional opener of the airshow season. Blue Angels expected Apr 10–11 on the team's preliminary schedule\; the teams rotate here year to year. Night airshows midweek.
